sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: ISO15118-20 transaction just started<br>exposing: <allowedEnergyTransferModes>, <transactionId>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Agree on energy transfer mode

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, requestedEnergyTransfer = AC_BPT, controlMode = ScheduledControl)
    Note right of CS: chargingNeeds.availableEnergyTransfer = [AC_single_phase, AC_two_phase,<br>AC_three_phase, AC_BPT, AC_BPT_DER, AC_DER]<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxChargePower = 1234W<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxDischargePower = 0W

    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse (status = Accepted or Processing)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted or Processing

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: N/a
